# Feature / entity modules

## Tier model

```
shared (Prisma, TX, filters, HTTP decorators)
feature facade (<feature>.module.ts)     → imports entity modules + controllers
entity module (infrastructure/modules/)  → repo TOKEN, UC useFactory, app ports
AppModule                                → imports feature facades
```

## Rules

- UC: plain class; `{ provide: UseCase, useFactory, inject }` — order = ctor
- Repo: `{ provide: *_REPOSITORY_TOKEN, useClass: Prisma* }`
- Application ports: bind adapter next to UC that needs them
- Do **not** re-provide Prisma / TRANSACTION_MANAGER globally
- Controllers inject **only** use-cases (see `controllers-no-repositories.mdc`)
- Export tokens/UC only when another module needs them
- New feature → `AppModule.imports`

